        "title": "[2607.24794] Reasoning with Memory: A Temporal Granularity-Adaptive Framework for Training-Free Long Video Understanding",
        "description": "Abstract page for arXiv paper 2607.24794: Reasoning with Memory: A Temporal Granularity-Adaptive Framework for Training-Free Long Video Understanding",
